{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"櫻坂46の井上梨名です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃめちゃ暑くなってきた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の夏は3回かき氷食べるって決めた。\nまだ食べてないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！でも、6月に1回食べてた！\nこれは夏の分にカウントされるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁよく分かんないから、今日から「今年の夏かき氷3回チャレンジ」始めます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京ドーム公演！ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Buddiesでいっぱいになった東京ドーム\n本当に本当嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に楽しい時間でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場には行けなかったという方も、配信を見てくださったり、それぞれの場所から応援してくださりありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Buddiesの声はどこにいても届いているし、力になっています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなBuddiesにずっと応援していたいと思ってもらえるグループ、人でいられるようにこれからも頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J7ATTTS5J0XNV1F1F0NN1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J7C1F2KVV0BEFTZG2FMMR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J7D1XMEZBJH16WW0JN0BD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J7E4VS2TM8HD0ENY6Z4PT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J7FA1EW9KHBBTTF71T0MR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J7GB7JPBJFZCV07VDDMEQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ笑顔ー\nBuddiesと目が合った時かなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はオンラインミーグリですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちの服にしようか、迷っています。\nどちらにしような？の歌で決めるか、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんとお話しできるの楽しみに待っていますー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J7H9HCZ45DXFZB6NJB9QG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1J7J9JEDNE70AQ50TTCTDE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前オンラインミーグリの時！\n久々の前髪だねー\nシュシュ見せたくて頑張って横向いてるー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいば〜い🦒"}],"source":"archive"}